# Binary assets — never text-normalise, diff or merge these.
# Keeps the generated resume PDF and every image/recording byte-exact across
# checkouts (the repo has core.autocrlf=true on Windows).
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
